					<description><![CDATA[Short film &#8211; 12:27 &#8211; 2023 Over the course of seven days, the “embodiment of roundness,” symbolized by the Drake Hotel, slowly collapses. The lauded inventor Ezekiel responds by offering his machine Rotubula, whose targeted gusts of wind are used to deflect the Drake’s falling debris. While seen as a savior, Ezekiel’s true motives are [&#8230;]]]></description>
